{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提摩太前書","commonName":"提摩太前書","title":"提摩太前書","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"1822fdddb64d09dc14c1e74356eb9c5a0d478ee65d890e82de816027d13aa2d2","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["謹防偽君子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["聖靈明確地說，日後必有人離棄真道，去追隨那些迷惑人的邪靈和鬼魔的學說。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["這些學說是出自假冒偽善的騙子，他們良心喪盡，麻木不仁",{"noteId":2},"，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["禁止人結婚和吃某些食物。其實那些食物是上帝創造的，為了讓相信並且明白真理的人存感恩的心領受。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["上帝所造的一切都是美好的，若以感恩的心去領受，就無需任何禁忌，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因為上帝的道和人的禱告可以使食物聖潔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["你若提醒弟兄姊妹這些事，就是基督耶穌的好僕人，在信仰之道和你所遵行的美善教導上得到了造就。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["做信徒的榜樣"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但你要棄絕世俗、荒誕的傳說，要訓練自己做敬虔的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["鍛煉身體益處還少，敬虔生活萬事受益，擁有今生和永世的應許。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這話真實可信，值得完全接受。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我們勞苦奮鬥正是為此，因為我們的盼望在於永活的上帝。祂是天下人的救主，更是信徒的救主。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["你要吩咐和教導這些事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["不要因為年輕而叫人小看你，總要在言語、行為、愛心、信心和純潔各方面做信徒的榜樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["在我來之前，你要專心宣讀聖經，勉勵會眾，教導真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["不要忽略你的恩賜，那是藉著預言在眾長老把手按在你身上時賜給你的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["你要全心全意做這些事，讓大家都看到你的長進。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["你要注意自己的言行和教導，並持之以恆。這樣，你不但能救自己，也能救那些聽你教導的人。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「良心喪盡，麻木不仁」希臘文是「良心被烙鐵燙過」。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":2}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/1TI/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}